<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update -Pakistan- Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update -Pakistan- Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Karachi, June 20 - Seven vessels waiting off port. Three container vessels, the first waiting two days. Two loaders, the first waiting four days. Two oil tankers, the first waiting two days. Six other vessels anchored off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
